Jesus came from Galilee to the Jordan River. He wanted to be baptized by John.
John tried to stop him. He said to Jesus, "I need you to baptize me. Why have you come to me?"
Jesus replied, "Let it be this way for now. It is proper for us to do this. She is carrying out the holy plan of God." Then John agreed.
