Jesus said to him, "Get behind me, Satan! For it is written, 'Worship the Lord your God, and serve him only.'" (Deuteronomy 6:13)
And after the devil had come out of Jesus, the angels came and took charge of him. Jesus began to preach.
John was imprisoned in prison. When Jesus heard about this story, he returned to Galilee.
