From that hour, Jesus began to preach. He said, "Depart from your sins!" "The Kingdom of Heaven is near." Jesus chooses the first disciples.
One day, Jesus was walking by the Sea of Galilee. There, he saw two brothers. They were Simon Peter and his brother Andrew. They were throwing a net into the lake. They were fishermen.
